/*
 * The prefix dg_ on every external name the vendored zstd defines (design
 * item 15), which gcc and clang compile its sources with and its headers in
 * include give their users, so no shared library's reference to zstd's own
 * names can bind to the fork's copy. The assembly source takes its names as
 * macros.
 */

